  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ffu - Fisheries Intelligence and MCS support in West Africa phase II</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Project&#x2019;s planned effect(s) on society (Impact) is/are to strengthen fisheries governance in the West African region, contributing to increased food security, reduced poverty, consistent government revenue, and sustaining of fishers livelihoods. The intended target group is the law enforcement agencies relevant to fisheries monitoring, control, surveillance and enforcement (MCSE) in the six West African countries (Nigeria, Benin, Togo, Ghana, Cote d&#x2019;Ivoire and Liberia) which are part of th</narrative>
  </description>
